# Build context hygiene for all images (M2-6a, CR-35). Keep secrets, local tooling, the Confidential
# DJI SDK, and heavy/irrelevant trees OUT of the build context so they can never land in an image layer.

# --- secrets: NEVER in an image (MANIFEST §3) ---
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- DJI Thermal SDK — Confidential (DJI EULA §14, CR-22). Must never enter any layer. ---
services/inference/app/radiometric/_dji_sdk_native.py
services/inference/vendor/dji-thermal-sdk/
**/libdirp*
**/dirp/

# --- dependencies / build output (reinstalled or rebuilt inside the image) ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Python local envs / caches ---
**/.venv
**/.venv-training
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# --- local tooling / agent config (not part of any service) ---
.claude/
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# --- tests, fixtures, coverage (not needed at runtime) ---
**/*.test.ts
**/e2e
**/tests/fixtures
**/coverage
tests/guardrails

# --- docs / misc ---
**/*.md
!services/inference/app/models/NOTICE
**/*.log
.DS_Store
docker-compose*.yml
